# MovingLeadsDaily — Competitive Intelligence
## Research Date: May 2026

## Competitors Analysed
- **MoverAlerts (TwentyCi)** — THE main competitor. Enterprise property data company with 31.5m addresses and 30bn data points. 12+ years in business. Affiliate member of BAR and Move Assured. Serve removal companies, storage, and retail.
- **TwentyCi** — Parent company. Massive data infrastructure. Serve enterprise clients like Savills, ATS Euromaster. Not focused on small removal companies.
- **RemovalReviews.co.uk** — Quote marketplace
- **AnyVan** — Booking platform (15-25% commission)
- **PropertyData.co.uk** — Property analytics (£14/mo)
- **Nethouseprices.com** — Free sold price data

## MoverAlerts Deep Dive

### What They Offer
- Home mover address leads for removal companies
- Data types: New Instructions, SSTC (Sold Subject to Contract), Withdrawn, Fallen Through
- Direct mail services (printed and posted letters)
- CRM integrations with Removals Manager and MoveMan
- Industry association memberships (BAR, Move Assured)

### Their Weaknesses (Where We Win)

| Factor | MoverAlerts | MovingLeadsDaily |
|--------|------------|-----------|
| **Pricing** | Enterprise (£300-500+/mo, custom quotes) | From £147/mo — fixed, transparent |
| **Signup** | Call sales, talk to account manager | Self-service, instant signup |
| **Free trial** | Unlikely — enterprise sales model | 7 days free, no card needed |
| **Focus** | All industries (removals, storage, retail) | Hyper-focused on removal companies |
| **Filters** | Postcode-based only | Property type, bedrooms, price range, timeframe |
| **Tech** | Legacy data infrastructure | Modern Apify + real-time scraping |
| **Data source** | Proprietary database (30bn data points) | Live Rightmove/Zoopla data — within 24h |

### What They Do Well (We Need To Match)
- **Direct mail service** — They print and post letters. We should offer this.
- **CRM integration** — They integrate with industry CRMs. We should integrate later.
- **Industry credibility** — 12 years with BAR. We need to build trust.

## Our Key Differentiators

1. **PRICE** — We're 50-70% cheaper than MoverAlerts. £147 vs likely £300-500+.
2. **SELF-SERVICE** — They require a phone call and account manager. We offer instant signup.
3. **FREE TRIAL** — They won't give you free access to their enterprise data. We give 7 days free.
4. **BETTER FILTERS** — They only filter by postcode. We filter by property type, beds, price, timeframe.
5. **REAL-TIME** — Their data is from a proprietary database (updated periodically). Ours is scraped live daily.
6. **EXCLUSIVITY** — They sell the same leads to multiple companies. We offer exclusive territory rights.

