## Common Objections & Responses
- "MoverAlerts has been around for 12 years" → "They're established, but you're paying for their overhead. Our data is fresher and cheaper."
- "How do I contact them without a name?" → "Post a letter to 'The Homeowner'. MoverAlerts gives you the same thing — just addresses."
- "What if no one responds?" → "5-10% conversion means 1 booking per 20 letters. At £300-800 per job, that's 6-16x ROI."
- "Can I try before I buy?" → "7 days free. No card. Keep the leads even if you leave."
